e_item_assets/steam/apps/2238620/ss_12dd052a55ced7a47f4d73a1919192b65da51bb6.600x338.jpg?t=1739899326"}],"short_description":"Dr. Finklestein's Marvelous Room is a community run experimental story game. With the end of the world fast approaching, Dr. Gumphrey Finklestein announces his plans for a groundbreaking scientific experiment. What will it entail? Does even he know?","steam_appid":2238620,"support_info":{"email":"contact@devbeef.com","url":"https://devbeef.com/discord"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, Russian, Spanish - Spain, Czech, Korean<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://devbeef.com"}